1:17	compose:defaults-visibility	manual	`Defaults` objects should match visibility of the composables they serve. `MyComposableDefaults` is internal but it should be public.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#componentdefaults-object-should-match-the-composable-visibility for more information.
4:16	compose:defaults-visibility	manual	`Defaults` objects should match visibility of the composables they serve. `MyOtherComposableDefaults` is private but it should be internal.\nSee https://mrmans0n.github.io/compose-rules/rules/#componentdefaults-object-should-match-the-composable-visibility for more information.
